# Ship only the docs the Marketplace actually renders. Everything else —
# internal notes, scratch files, agent instruction files — must never reach
# the .vsix. v0.2.1 leaked TODO.md / CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md / *.txt this way.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
*.txt
!LICENSE.txt
